-- erwartet: N218
-- Lane E6: a profile that contradicts the float prelude is refused. The
-- prelude binds `-ffp-contract=off` for every compiler (PLAN-BITS.md §5),
-- so `fp_contract fast` re-opens what the prelude closed. The key holds
-- one value, so `N215` stays silent. Exactly one `N218` falls.

module gift::profil_gegen_vorsatz {

profile {
    fp_contract fast;
};

}
